// Article 3. Violations and fines: notice, a hearing, a finding, and only then a fine.
#require "1-association.charter".
Param maximum-fine : Money(USD, 2) = 10000
Fact violation
Evidenced Fact committed Identified by owner * violation
Fact notified Identified by owner * violation
Fact answer Identified by Yes, No

Act give-notice Actor board Recipient owner Related to violation
  Holds when True
  Creates notified()
Finding hear Actor board Recipient owner Related to violation, answer
  Resolves committed() When answer == Yes
  Resolves !committed() When answer == No
  Holds when Held(notified()) For 10
  Valid when Held(notified()) For 10
Power fine Actor board Recipient owner Related to violation, usd
  Holds when committed() && usd <= maximum-fine
  Valid when committed() && usd <= maximum-fine
  Creates fine-due()
Duty fine-due Holder owner Claimant association Related to violation, usd
  Due within 30
  Terminated by pay-fine
Act pay-fine Actor owner Recipient association Related to violation, usd

Clause 3.1 Approved "0f735775534f716c4020a90e6feb4197b89253721812ff3c44d8b4424d703503"
  Norm "The board may fine an owner for a violation of these rules only after written notice and a hearing." => give-notice, hear, fine
Clause 3.2 Approved "afb30b5183c15f6166b52a476aa1cf6379c6c8ccc079e2c9ef019c8657851c3d"
  Norm "The notice states the violation alleged." => give-notice
  Norm " The hearing is held no sooner than ten days after the notice, so that the owner can prepare an answer." => hear
Clause 3.3 Approved "a5a4bbbb4dae321c3b9770b883c094d8dc80ceab221c6649dfcd2a2fd87050b7"
  Norm "At the hearing the board finds whether the owner committed the violation." => hear
Clause 3.4 Approved "6cf826483068f32575a820922198ba4e04445bd80d610818a8495fad0ac3b644"
  Norm "The board may fine the owner up to one hundred dollars for a violation it has found." => fine
  Norm " A fine for a violation the board has not found has no effect." => fine
Clause 3.5 Approved "eb16a7194307b4148eb4074e52142af7da8163591fe317f82f1768291fa30660"
  Norm "The owner pays a fine within thirty days after it is imposed." => fine-due, pay-fine
.
